                  "group": "",
                  "groupIndex": 0,
                  "text": "Custom dash from CAN broadcast data, decoded with a DBC file (rusEFI first, any DBC later):\n- signal definitions converted on the PC, loaded from the SD card\n- tile layout and alarm limits from the SD card, edited in the PC tool\n- listen only: works next to OBD, on the board CAN",
